{"version":1,"content":"<p>自去年發售以來，Switch 2已經證明自己是一台性能強勁的便攜式主機，而《塞爾達傳説：時之笛》重製版或許正是最能展現其性能的遊戲。與1998年首次亮相的N64原版相比，這個經典冒險的升級版本看起來更加出色。任天堂充分利用Switch 2的硬件，打造出了這款遊戲的終極版本，將富有氛圍感的場景設計與充滿想像力的角色模型融為一體。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1585472.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.651063+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T08:19:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"59cea4bf8274039a573db3c5a52722105102cd8fe01d0fd19caf6e0c05f9fc62","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}